### parity summary ###
web source: web/src/components/layout/PageHeaderSticky.tsx (verified vs __tests__/PageHeaderSticky.test.tsx).
nature: pure presentational layout chrome — IntersectionObserver-driven sticky bar; no fetch, no data port
  (no P1/S8 Source/ViewModel), mirroring the sibling presentational AlertBanner surface.
visibility (web !entry.isIntersecting && entry.boundingClientRect.top < 0): reproduced verbatim by the pure
  stickyHeaderVisible(); snapshotFromHero() derives the two observer inputs from native LazyList geometry (the
  platform IntersectionObserver equivalent). Long-page guard (hero still below viewport stays hidden) covered.
states reproduced (every one renders — no hidden surface invented): hidden (hero in view / below -> renders
  nothing, faithful to web if (!visible) return null, zero layout not a blank box) / visible + scroll-to-top
  button + up glyph (default) / visible plain region (scrollToTop=false, no button, no glyph) / empty body ->
  localized common.noData caption (never a blank bar). The generic loading/error/stale/offline states do not
  apply to scroll-driven chrome that fetches nothing (documented in PageHeaderStickyModel.kt).
a11y: the bar is one merged node named by the caller's localized ariaLabel (+ spoken summary); exposed as a
  Role.Button when actionable (idiomatic Compose equivalent of the web icon-only button aria-label); the up
  glyph is decorative; reduced motion honored via shared FadeIn.
i18n: empty-body caption via existing P1/S10 key translation_common_noData (reused, precedent: AlertBanner);
  the surface introduces no English literal in shipped code.
diagnostics (P1/S11): one-shot PII-safe view.opened {surface=PageHeaderSticky} via the redacting Logger on
  first composition — never page content, target id, or scroll position.
files: shared-surfaces/PageHeaderSticky/{PageHeaderSticky.kt, PageHeaderStickyModel.kt};
  test/pageheadersticky/{PageHeaderStickyModelTest.kt, PageHeaderStickyDiagnosticsTest.kt};
  androidTest/pageheadersticky/PageHeaderStickyUiTest.kt.
